  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Cutoff status",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messes/{{messId}}/meals/cutoff?date={{tomorrow}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "messes",
            "{{messId}}",
            "meals",
            "cutoff"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "date",
              "value": "{{tomorrow}}",
              "description": "Kon date-er kotha jante chao (khali rakhle aj)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "**Ki kore:** Ekta date ekhon edit kora jabe kina, ar na gele keno — seta bole.\n\n**Kokhon lagbe:** Frontend-e meal page-er upore banner dekhate (\"aj rat 10ta porjonto somoy ache\").\n\n**Expect:** `200` + `{ editable, reason, mealCutoffTime, cutoffDaysAhead, timezone }`"
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Set my meal — tomorrow  ⭐",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messes/{{messId}}/meals/my/{{tomorrow}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "messes",
            "{{messId}}",
            "meals",
            "my",
            "{{tomorrow}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "**⭐ Ei API tai sob cheye beshi call hobe.**\n\n**Ki kore:** Nijer ek diner meal set kore (upsert — thakle update, na thakle create).\n\n**Quantity rules:**\n- `0.5` step-e hote hobe — `0.7` dile `400`\n- guest meal alada field-e, kintu total-e jog hoy\n- `totalMealUnits` = breakfast + lunch + dinner + guest tinta\n\n**URL-er date ta `{{tomorrow}}`** — collection-er pre-request script Dhaka time dhore auto set kore.\n\n**Expect:** `200` + `totalMealUnits: \"4.50\"`",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"breakfast\": 1,\n  \"lunch\": 1.5,\n  \"dinner\": 1,\n  \"guestLunch\": 1,\n  \"note\": \"Ekjon guest lunch-e\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test(\"Total calculated\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.totalMealUnits).to.eql(\"4.50\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
