    {
      "name": "Copy meals to multiple days",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messes/{{messId}}/meals/my/copy",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "messes",
            "{{messId}}",
            "meals",
            "my",
            "copy"
          ]
        },
        "description": "**Ki kore:** Ek diner meal onek din-e copy kore — \"same for 7 days\" button-er jonno.\n\n**Important:** je din gulo cutoff-er baire ba month closed, segulo **skip** hoy — chupchap fail hoy na. Response-e `applied[]` ar `skipped[]` duitai ase, `skipped`-e karon soho.\n\n**`overwrite: false`** hole already entry thaka din gulo skip hobe.\n\n**Expect:** `200`. `cutoffDaysAhead: 1` thakle beshirbhag din skip hobe — seta thik, response dekho.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"fromDate\": \"{{tomorrow}}\",\n  \"toDates\": [\n    \"{{plus2}}\",\n    \"{{plus3}}\"\n  ],\n  \"overwrite\": false\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "console.log(\"applied:\", pm.response.json().data.applied, \"| skipped:\", JSON.stringify(pm.response.json().data.skipped));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
